2
00:11:34,285 --> 00:11:40,285
Hitchcock/Truffaut is a documentary film directed by Kent Jones.

3
00:17:21,428 --> 00:17:27,428
Filmmakers discuss the legacy of Alfred Hitchcock and the book “Hitchcock/Truffaut” (“Le
cinéma selon Hitchcock”), written by François Truffaut and published in 1966.

